\ tests/native/kernel-inl.4 - CV8's inlining (Iteration 683): a call to a
\ small straight word is replaced by a copy of its body. The native kernel
\ does not inline this way, so it is the oracle: CV8's engines must print
\ what it prints. Slots re-aimed from their new place, near and far (the
\ three-byte form, past 16 KB); calls copied as they are; what must not
\ be copied left a call - a word that takes its return address, the
\ return stack, a branch; constants, ESC primitives, EXECUTE, nesting.
VARIABLE NEAR  : GETN NEAR @ ;  : SETN NEAR ! ;
: USEN 5 SETN GETN 1+ ;  USEN .
VARIABLE FAR  20000 ALLOT  : GETF FAR @ ;  : SETF FAR ! ;
: USEF 7 SETF GETF 2* GETF + ;  USEF .
: DBL DUP + ;  : QUAD DBL DBL ;  : OCT QUAD DBL ;  3 OCT .
: SQ DUP * ;  : SUMSQ SQ SWAP SQ + ;  3 4 SUMSQ .
: HELLO S" hi" ;  : SAY HELLO TYPE ;  SAY SPACE
: TOPR R@ DROP 9 ;  : USER TOPR 1+ ;  USER .
: ABS1 DUP 0< IF NEGATE THEN ;  : USEA -6 ABS1 ;  USEA .
1000000000000 CONSTANT BIG  : BIG+ BIG + ;  : USEB 1 BIG+ ;  USEB .
: LEN CSTRLEN ;  CREATE CS 65 C, 66 C, 0 C,  : USEL CS LEN ;  USEL .
: RUN EXECUTE ;  : USEX ['] DBL 21 SWAP RUN ;  USEX .
: SWP SWAP ;  : USES 1 2 SWP - ;  USES .
DEPTH . CR
.( end) CR   \ the last line: verify's native_cmp wants it (656)
BYE
